      "created_at": "2017-01-09T15:07:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-01-09T15:07:38Z",
      "body": "I don't see how we can include this in voctomix without mixing up multiple, not related systems. Voctomix is a video-mixing-software, it does not care about the angel-system and I don't want to mix them up.\r\n\r\nIt should be trivial to get the information, which talk was mixed by which mixer-angel from the angel-system, so we should better discuss there, how we can export and manage this information in compliance with their privacy rules.",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
